lang":"en"},"children":["Don’t stop proper treatment to try folk remedies or supplements"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Among people with potentially treatable cancer, those using only alternative therapy instead of conventional treatment had 2.5 times the risk of death. People adding complementary therapy more often refused chemotherapy or radiotherapy along the way, accounting for the excess deaths. Some herbs also weaken anti-rejection or anticoagulant drugs; ask your treating doctor before taking them."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost at all;"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Two studies from US cancer registries examined nonmetastatic, potentially treatable breast, prostate, lung and…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Don’t stop proper treatment to try folk remedies or supplements"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost at all; you even save money you’d otherwise spend on supplements. It takes no extra time. The hard part is resisting repeated pressure from others to give it a try."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Two studies from US cancer registries examined nonmetastatic, potentially treatable breast, prostate, lung and colorectal cancers. The first examined people using alternative therapy alone, refusing surgery, chemotherapy, radiotherapy and hormone therapy. Compared with matched conventional-treatment patients, their risk of death was 2.5 times as high (HR 2.50, 95% CI 1.88–3.27, about 150% higher). For breast cancer it was 5.68 times (3.22–10.04), lung cancer 2.17 times (1.42–3.32) and colorectal cancer 4.57 times (1.66–12.61). The second examined complementary therapy alongside conventional treatment. Refusal rates were 7.0% versus 0.1% for surgery, 34.1% versus 3.2% for chemotherapy, 53.0% versus 2.3% for radiotherapy, and 33.7% versus 2.8% for hormone therapy. Five-year survival was 82.2% versus 86.6%; death risk was 2.08 times as high (HR 2.08, 1.50–2.90, about twice as high). After accounting for delay and refusal, complementary therapy itself showed no clear association with death (HR 1.39, 0.83–2.33). The authors concluded that excess deaths came from refusing conventional treatment. China's State Administration for Market Regulation requires health-food labels to state that health foods are not medicines and cannot replace medicines for treating disease. The US National Center for Complementary and Integrative Health (NCCIH) states that St John's wort reduces the effects of many medicines, including cyclosporine for transplant rejection prevention and the anticoagulant warfarin."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Johnson SB, Park HS, Gross CP, Yu JB (2018). Use of Alternative Medicine for Cancer and Its Impact on Survival. Journal of the National Cancer Institute, 110(1), 121-124. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1093/jnci/djx145","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1093/jnci/djx145"]},"；Johnson SB, Park HS, Gross CP, Yu JB (2018). Complementary Medicine, Refusal of Conventional Cancer Therapy, and Survival Among Patients With Curable Cancers. JAMA Oncology, 4(10), 1375-1381. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1001/jamaoncol.2018.2487","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1001/jamaoncol.2018.2487"]},"；国家市场监督管理总局 (2019). 市场监管总局就《保健食品标注警示用语指南》和《保健食品原料目录与保健功能目录管理办法》有关情况举办专题新闻发布会. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.samr.gov.cn/tssps/sjdt/tpxw/art/2023/art_4b658b824b1b4b0ba57c09a56cc93aad.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.samr.gov.cn/tssps/sjdt/tpxw/art/2023/art_4b658b824b1b4b0ba57c09a56cc93aad.html"]},"；National Center for Complementary and Integrative Health (2025). St. John's Wort. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.nccih.nih.gov/health/st-johns-wort","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.nccih.nih.gov/health/st-johns-wort"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1093/jnci/djx145","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Rated only B. Both studies concerned cancer alone and followed registry data without randomized groups; people choosing alternatives may also differ in other ways. For stopping medicines for hypertension or diabetes, see item 1 (take the prescribed course). Tell your treating doctor before trying supplements. For whether health products are worth buying, see Section 6, item 10 (health products, herbal pastes and tonics)."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/16-03"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fi